WEBVTT

00:03:29.167 --> 00:03:30.692
And that's a useful lie to have.

00:03:30.716 --> 00:03:33.257
It's a lie we have on
the first mountain of our lives,

00:03:33.281 --> 00:03:36.072
because it motivates us
to start companies and take risks.

00:03:36.096 --> 00:03:38.127
But if you've achieved
any success in life,

00:03:38.151 --> 00:03:39.670
you realize that is a lie,

00:03:39.694 --> 00:03:42.776
that success does not actually
make you feel fulfilled,

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:46.673
that the only way you feel fulfilled
is by giving love and receiving love.

00:03:46.697 --> 00:03:48.585
And so, on the second mountain of life,

00:03:48.609 --> 00:03:51.156
you realize you're at a very
different mode of living.

00:03:51.180 --> 00:03:54.923
It's not about earning and acquiring,
it's about contributing and giving back.

00:03:54.947 --> 00:03:58.312
CA: Is your belief that most people
literally have these two mountains,

00:03:58.336 --> 00:04:02.036
where they spend the first decade
or two of their adult life